              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " completely, leaving behind the solid mixture (Fig. 9.6). Common salt is then obtained from this mixture by further purification."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.304,
