            0.719,
            0.25
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Find out about some water bodies in India that contain common salt. One such source is Sambhar Lake in Rajasthan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
