            0.254,
            0.786,
            0.883,
            0.872
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Do you observe some patches on the paper? What do you think is left on the paper? You can feel the presence of salt by touching the paper. Where has the water disappeared? Recall the chapter ‘A Journey through States of Water’."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.875,
            0.67,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us probe further to get the answer."
            }
